Driveway
This is quite a seedy neighborhood, but there isn't really anywhere in the 
whole Las Mesas metro area that isn't at least a little rundown. Of course, the 
locals may complain about the ugliness and the crime, but the fact is that a 
starter home like this one would cost easily five times as much in someplace 
like Las Playas - and that's if you could find one.

